WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.569 line:0%
I am just incredibly humbled,
blessed.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.171
♪ (HIP HOP MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:06.772 --> 00:00:10.276
<i> You aspire a dream I never
 imagined I would get</i>

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:13.078
<i> to work with so many amazing,
 talented people.</i>

00:00:13.178 --> 00:00:14.847
You guys have elevated me.

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:16.049
(CHEERING)

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:18.518
PRENTICE PENNY:<i> Working
 in television for a long time</i>

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:21.087
and not being able to see
people that looked like me,

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:22.888
<i> to be able to do a show
 like that now</i>

00:00:22.988 --> 00:00:25.691
<i>sets the groundwork that people
want to make more shows like us</i>

00:00:25.791 --> 00:00:26.792
is just really special.

00:00:27.526 --> 00:00:29.395
I put in all elements
of my life,

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:31.898
<i> so I can say this is rooted
 in authenticity,</i>

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:33.400
and they were like,
"Okay, green light."

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.669
NATASHA ROTHWELL:<i> For people
 of color in this industry,</i>

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:38.171 line:0%
the fear of failure is so real

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:40.140
<i> because we don't get
 that many opportunities.</i>

00:00:42.441 --> 00:00:45.444
This show has been part
of the revolution.

00:00:46.045 --> 00:00:47.547
<i> The way you showcase
 our beautiful,</i>

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:49.081
<i> Black full humanity,</i>

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:50.417
<i> it's part of the revolution.</i>

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:53.586
We all owe so much to you.

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.622
JAY ELLIS:<i> It's rare to go
 to work every day</i>

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:59.426
and love every single person
we've had on our production.

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:02.595
It's all you can dream for.

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:09.536
-That's a wrap.
-(CHEERING)

